  "name": "Lokalise - Screenshots &amp; Descriptions (ad hoc)",
  "description": "Scratch driver for linking Figma screenshots to Lokalise keys and writing key descriptions. Config node holds the phase; Fetch node calls the Lokalise API; Shape returns compact rows.",
